---
source: tests/cli/search.rs
expression: text(&output.stdout)?
---
find datasets on hugging face, kaggle and zenodo

usage: fetchloom search [options] <words>...

arguments:
  <words>...  dataset names or keywords, with or without quotes

options:
  -q, --quiet         print only the answer and errors
  -v, --verbose...    say more: -v adds detail and counters, -vv adds debug logs
      --json          print one JSON document on stdout instead of the story
      --offline       use only what is already on this machine
  -y, --yes           approve confirmations, but never choose a dataset for you
      --color <when>  when to use color [default: auto] [possible values: auto, always, never]
  -C <dir>            run as if fetchloom started in <dir>
  -h, --help          print help

examples:
  fetchloom search iris
  fetchloom search fashion mnist
  fetchloom search iris --json

on disk: nothing. prints canonical references without downloading a dataset
